    "description": "Drawing on Elizabeth Anderson, this essay argues that equality should secure equal social standing and overcome oppression, rather than merely compensate for bad luck.",
    "author": "Linlin Feng",
    "format": "DOCX",
    "file": "equality-as-equal-standing.docx",
